<title>BELGIUM: TABLE - BELGIAN NET DEBT 9,850.5 BLN BFR IN JULY.</title>
<headline>TABLE - BELGIAN NET DEBT 9,850.5 BLN BFR IN JULY.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury released the following data on the state's debt (in billion francs):</p>
<p>    STATE DEBT	     end-July  change in mth  change in 1997</p>
<p>Long-term debt</p>
<p>    Belgian francs	 6,990.0   +50.6	     -  8.8</p>
<p>    foreign currencies     698.7   + 1.5	     + 40.1</p>
<p>Short-term debt</p>
<p>    Belgian francs	 1,976.0  -122.8	     +185.7</p>
<p>    foreign currencies	95.7   + 5.4	     + 20.3</p>
<p>Net debt		     9,850.5   -39.3	     +321.9</p>
<p>Net borrowing requirement	     39.3		249.8</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
